{"name":"Contessa","hex":"#c16f68","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"contessa","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A countess, often specifically an Italian countess"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/contessa"}],"entries":[{"title":"Contessa (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Contessa is a 2018 Indian Malayalam drama film, written and directed by Sudip E.S. The film stars Appani Sarath, Sreejith Ravi, Hareesh Peradi, Zinil Zainuddin, etc. in lead roles. The film has its story written by Riyas. This film was released on 23 November 2018."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/17/Contessa_%28film%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Contessa_(film)","wikidata":"Q59732926"},{"title":"Contessa (TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Contessa (transl. countess) is a 2018 Philippine television drama thriller series broadcast by GMA Network. Directed by Albert Langitan, it stars Glaiza de Castro in the title role. It premiered on March 19, 2018, on the network's Afternoon Prime and Sabado Star Power sa Hapon line up. The series concluded on September 8, 2018, with a total of 147 episodes."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/b/b7/Contessa_title_card.jpg/330px-Contessa_title_card.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Contessa_(TV_series)","wikidata":"Q46607764"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/78/Glaiza_de_Castro.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/78/Glaiza_de_Castro.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGlaiza_de_Castro.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/40/Jak_Roberto_a